# CineSync OS Backend Environment Variables
# In blueprint/showcase mode, no keys are required.
# To generate live AI video from screenplay prompts, supply your own API keys below:

# SiliconFlow API Key for Wan-AI (Wan2.2) Text-to-Video generation:
SILICONFLOW_API_KEY=your_siliconflow_api_key_here

# Anthropic API Key for live Claude 3.5 Sonnet script analysis & shot decomposition:
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

